        <mxCell id="gates" value="MIGRATION FACTORY GATES&#xa;1. DISCOVER — inventory + dependencies     2. ASSESS — readiness + sizing     3. PILOT — test + remediate&#xa;4. CUT OVER — approved change window     5. VALIDATE — app + data + security     6. OPERATE — hypercare + handover&#xa;&#xa;REFERENCE DESIGN • confirm service prerequisites, region availability, IP overlap, security policy, and workload-specific RTO/RPO before deployment." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0B2944;strokeColor=#2C6389;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=16;spacing=18;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="840" width="1460" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
